  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "Supporters answer that a flight does not pay for the damage it does either. They point to a study of the Vienna to Brussels corridor, where a night train would emit one fifth of the carbon of the same journey by air, and where more than nine in ten travellers said they would choose it if the fare were within a quarter of the cheapest flight.",
