  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "The next morning the train ran along the edge of the lagoon,which was grey and still, and arrived in Venice eleven minutes early. Kovac, who had slept better than she had for months, ate a roll in the carriage and watched the water slide by. She said she would take the sleeper again in the autumn, and that she had already booked a berth for her mother.",
