  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "Operators are learning that the product is as much hotelas railway. The new cabins have blackout blinds, sound-proofed doors andsmall washbasins, and the most expensive carry a shower. Booking systems now sell a berth the way an airline sells a seat, with cheaper fares for those who accept a shared compartment.",
