  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "Not every plan has survived contact with the budget. A Swedish service to Hamburg was postponed twice because the carriages arrived late, and a French line to Barcelona runs only on weekends. Even so, the number of overnight passengers in Europe grew by a third in the last two years, according to the railway statisticians.",
